{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50645","headline":"九销山 · 徐凝","name":"九销山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人行之字路嶔巇，九销青山胜九疑。\n只被但白云生不断，无端点破碧琉璃。\n（见道士孟宗宝集虚所编《洞霄诗集》卷一。\n）（〖1〗邓牧《洞霄图志》卷二《山水门》《九锁山》条：「自余杭西郭外，行十有八里，逆溪水上，左右合七峯，皆拔地数百尺。\n其趾犬牙相错，行路并溪屈折者九，故云九锁。\n好事者悉命以名。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}